<p>A <code>Document</code> is the root object that all the other pieces of Pop PDF assembles into — pages, fonts, styles and
forms.</p>
<h2 id="creating-a-document">Creating a Document<a class="anchor" href="#creating-a-document" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>The constructor takes an optional first page, optional metadata and an optional style or array of
styles, and every argument can be left off:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>));
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>An empty <code>new Document()</code> holds no pages at all — <a href="#adding-pages">Adding Pages</a> covers every way to
give it one. Leaving the metadata argument off still creates a default <code>Metadata</code> instance, so
<a href="/build/metadata"><code>getMetadata()</code></a> always returns an object rather than <code>null</code>. See
<a href="/build/metadata">Metadata</a> for the second argument and <a href="/build/text">Adding Text</a>
for the third.</p>
<h2 id="adding-pages">Adding Pages<a class="anchor" href="#adding-pages" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>addPage()</code> takes a <code>Page</code> object and appends it, returning the document so calls chain:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPage</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>));
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPage</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">A4</span>));
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>Sizes can differ per page — see <a href="/build/pages">Pages &amp; Coordinates</a>.</p>
<p><code>addPages()</code> takes an array of <code>Page</code> objects and adds every one of them in order, in a single call:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPages</span>([
    <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>),
    <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>),
    <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LEGAL</span>),
]);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>createPage()</code> builds the <code>Page</code> for you — pass it the same size argument a <code>Page</code> constructor takes
— adds it to the document, and returns the new page rather than the document, so it's the shortcut
when the next thing you do is add content to that page:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$page</span> = <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">createPage</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>All three count toward <a href="#the-current-page"><code>getNumberOfPages()</code></a> the same way, and pages keep the
order they were added in until <a href="#copying-reordering-and-deleting"><code>orderPages()</code></a> changes it.
<code>createPage()</code> is the odd one out among the three, returning the page itself rather than the
document, since it hands back the object you're about to draw on:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Text</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addFont</span>(<span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">ARIAL</span>);
<span class="text-var">$page</span> = <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">createPage</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>);
<span class="text-var">$page</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addText</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Invoice #1042&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">14</span>), <span class="text-str">&#039;Arial&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">700</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<h2 id="copying-reordering-and-deleting">Copying, Reordering and Deleting<a class="anchor" href="#copying-reordering-and-deleting" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>copyPage()</code> clones an existing page, by its 1-indexed position, and appends the clone at the end of
the document. The clone is independent from the moment it's made — changes to the copy never touch
the original:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPages</span>([<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>), <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LEGAL</span>)]);

<span class="text-var">$copy</span> = <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">copyPage</span>(<span class="text-num">1</span>);
<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getNumberOfPages</span>(); <span class="text-comment">// 3</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>The clone carries every image, text run, path and field the original has. Pass <code>false</code> as the second
argument for an identical size and index with none of it:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-var">$blank</span> = <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">copyPage</span>(<span class="text-num">2</span>, <span class="text-type">preserveContent</span>: <span class="text-num">false</span>);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>A position outside the document raises <code>Pop\Pdf\Document\Exception</code>, naming the position:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">try</span> {
    <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">copyPage</span>(<span class="text-num">99</span>);
} <span class="text-kw">catch</span> (<span class="text-type">\Pop\Pdf\Document\Exception</span> <span class="text-var">$exception</span>) {
    <span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$exception</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getMessage</span>(); <span class="text-comment">// Error: That page (99) does not exist.</span>
}
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>orderPages()</code> takes an array naming, in the new order, the 1-indexed page number for each position
— <code>[3, 1, 2]</code> puts the current page 3 first, page 1 second, page 2 last. The array must name every
page exactly once; a wrong length or an unknown page number raises <code>Pop\Pdf\Document\Exception</code>:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPages</span>([<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>), <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LEGAL</span>), <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">A4</span>)]);

<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">orderPages</span>([<span class="text-num">3</span>, <span class="text-num">1</span>, <span class="text-num">2</span>]);
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>The two error cases have distinct messages:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">try</span> {
    <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">orderPages</span>([<span class="text-num">3</span>, <span class="text-num">1</span>]); <span class="text-comment">// only 2 entries for a 3-page document</span>
} <span class="text-kw">catch</span> (<span class="text-type">\Pop\Pdf\Document\Exception</span> <span class="text-var">$exception</span>) {
    <span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$exception</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getMessage</span>();
    <span class="text-comment">// Error: The pages array passed does not contain the same number of pages as the PDF.</span>
}

<span class="text-kw">try</span> {
    <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">orderPages</span>([<span class="text-num">3</span>, <span class="text-num">1</span>, <span class="text-num">9</span>]);
} <span class="text-kw">catch</span> (<span class="text-type">\Pop\Pdf\Document\Exception</span> <span class="text-var">$exception</span>) {
    <span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$exception</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getMessage</span>();
    <span class="text-comment">// Error: The pages array passed contains a page that does not exist.</span>
}
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>deletePage()</code> removes a page by its 1-indexed position without renumbering the rest: delete page 1
from a three-page document and pages 2 and 3 keep their numbers, while <code>getPage(1)</code> raises
<code>Pop\Pdf\Exception</code> until something fills it. A page added afterward takes the next number after the
highest in use, not the gap — delete page 1, add one, and you get pages 2, 3 and 4:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPages</span>([<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>), <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LEGAL</span>), <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">A4</span>)]);

<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">deletePage</span>(<span class="text-num">1</span>);
<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getNumberOfPages</span>(); <span class="text-comment">// 2</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>orderPages()</code> closes that gap, since it rebuilds the page list from scratch — passing the surviving
page numbers in their current order renumbers the document back to a clean, gap-free sequence:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">orderPages</span>([<span class="text-num">2</span>, <span class="text-num">3</span>]);
<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getPage</span>(<span class="text-num">1</span>)-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getWidth</span>(); <span class="text-comment">// the page that used to answer to number 2</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>deletePage()</code> raises the same exception, worded the same way, for a position the document does not
have.</p>
<h2 id="the-current-page">The Current Page<a class="anchor" href="#the-current-page" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>An empty <code>new Document()</code> starts with no current page at all — <code>getCurrentPage()</code> returns <code>null</code> and
<code>getNumberOfPages()</code> returns <code>0</code> until the first page is added. From there it moves automatically:
<code>addPage()</code>, <code>addPages()</code>, <code>createPage()</code> and <code>copyPage()</code> all set it to the page most recently
added. <code>setCurrentPage()</code> moves it explicitly and <code>getCurrentPage()</code> reads it back:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPages</span>([<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>), <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>)]);

<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setCurrentPage</span>(<span class="text-num">1</span>);
<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getCurrentPage</span>();    <span class="text-comment">// 1</span>
<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getNumberOfPages</span>();  <span class="text-comment">// 2</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>setCurrentPage()</code> raises <code>Pop\Pdf\Document\Exception</code> for a page number the document doesn't have.
Deleting the current page moves the pointer instead of leaving it dangling: it becomes one less than
the pages remaining, or nothing once the document is empty — delete page 5 from a five-page document
and the current page becomes 3.</p>
<p>The current page is bookkeeping for the caller only — nothing inside Pop PDF reads it back to decide
what to compile.</p>
<h2 id="inspecting-a-document">Inspecting a Document<a class="anchor" href="#inspecting-a-document" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>Every collection a document holds — pages, fonts, styles and forms — has a <code>has*()</code> that reports
whether any exist and a <code>get*()</code> that returns them.</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>));
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addFont</span>(<span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">ARIAL</span>);

<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">hasPages</span>();   <span class="text-comment">// true</span>
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">hasFonts</span>();   <span class="text-comment">// true</span>
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">hasStyles</span>();  <span class="text-comment">// false</span>
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">hasForms</span>();   <span class="text-comment">// false</span>

<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getPages</span>();          <span class="text-comment">// array of Page objects</span>
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getAvailableFonts</span>(); <span class="text-comment">// [&#039;Arial&#039;]</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>getPage()</code> returns a single page by its 1-indexed position, and <code>getFont()</code> and <code>getStyle()</code> return
a single member of their collection by name — all three raise an exception when the document doesn't
have what was asked for. <code>isFontAvailable()</code>/<code>hasFont()</code> and <code>isStyleAvailable()</code>/<code>hasStyle()</code> are
each the same check under two names:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-var">$page</span> = <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getPage</span>(<span class="text-num">1</span>);
<span class="text-var">$arial</span> = <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getFont</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Arial&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">isFontAvailable</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Arial&#039;</span>); <span class="text-comment">// true</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p><code>getForm()</code> is the one accessor here that doesn't throw — a name the document doesn't have returns
<code>null</code>, so it's safe to call before checking <code>hasForms()</code>:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$form</span> = <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getForm</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;contact&#039;</span>); <span class="text-comment">// null, no exception</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>The full set of collection accessors:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>getPages()</code> / <code>getPage($p)</code> / <code>hasPages()</code> — every page, one page by position, or whether any exist</li>
<li><code>getFonts()</code> / <code>getFont($name)</code> / <code>hasFonts()</code> / <code>getAvailableFonts()</code> / <code>hasFont($name)</code> — the
document's fonts, keyed by name</li>
<li><code>getStyles()</code> / <code>getStyle($name)</code> / <code>hasStyles()</code> / <code>getAvailableStyles()</code> / <code>hasStyle($name)</code> —
the same shape for styles</li>
<li><code>getForms()</code> / <code>getForm($name)</code> / <code>hasForms()</code> — form definitions, added with <code>addForm()</code></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="compression">Compression<a class="anchor" href="#compression" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>setCompression()</code> turns on stream compression for everything the document writes; <code>isCompressed()</code>
reports whether it is on. It defaults to <code>false</code>:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">isCompressed</span>();     <span class="text-comment">// false</span>
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setCompression</span>(<span class="text-num">true</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">isCompressed</span>();     <span class="text-comment">// true</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>The saving is real and depends on content — a five-page document built from forty lines of repeated
text per page plus one filled rectangle compiled to 29,562 bytes uncompressed and 4,506 bytes with
<code>setCompression(true)</code>, a difference of 25,056 bytes, about 85% smaller.</p>
<p>Turn it on before the first call that compiles the document — <code>writeToFile()</code>, <code>outputToHttp()</code> or a
cast to string — since compression happens at compile time, not when content is added.</p>
<h2 id="pdf-version">PDF Version<a class="anchor" href="#pdf-version" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>setVersion()</code> and <code>getVersion()</code> control the version number written into the file header. It
defaults to <code>1.7</code>:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getVersion</span>();  <span class="text-comment">// 1.7</span>

<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setVersion</span>(<span class="text-num">1.4</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getVersion</span>();  <span class="text-comment">// 1.4</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

<p>The version compiles straight into the first line of the output — a document with <code>setVersion(1.4)</code>
in force opens with <code>%PDF-1.4</code> rather than <code>%PDF-1.7</code>. Pop PDF doesn't gate any feature behind the
version number, so setting it lower disables nothing; it's only worth changing to match a target
format requirement a downstream consumer specifies.</p>
<h2 id="rendering-to-a-string">Rendering to a String<a class="anchor" href="#rendering-to-a-string" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p>Casting a document to a string compiles it and returns the raw PDF bytes in memory, the same bytes
<code>writeToFile()</code> writes for that document — see
<a href="/build/output#getting-the-raw-bytes">Getting the Raw Bytes</a>.</p>
<p>A short document assembled from several pieces on this page — two pages built directly, one copied
and reordered ahead of them:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Page\Text</span>;
<span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Pdf\Document\Font</span>;

<span class="text-var">$document</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Document</span>();
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addFont</span>(<span class="text-type">Font</span>::<span class="text-num">ARIAL</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addPage</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Page</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>));

<span class="text-var">$page</span> = <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">createPage</span>(<span class="text-type">Page</span>::<span class="text-num">LETTER</span>);
<span class="text-var">$page</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addText</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Text</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Page two&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">size</span>: <span class="text-num">12</span>), <span class="text-str">&#039;Arial&#039;</span>, <span class="text-type">x</span>: <span class="text-num">100</span>, <span class="text-type">y</span>: <span class="text-num">700</span>);

<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">copyPage</span>(<span class="text-num">1</span>, <span class="text-type">preserveContent</span>: <span class="text-num">false</span>);
<span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">orderPages</span>([<span class="text-num">3</span>, <span class="text-num">1</span>, <span class="text-num">2</span>]);

<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$document</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">getNumberOfPages</span>(); <span class="text-comment">// 3</span>
<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-fn">strlen</span>(<span class="text-kw">(string)</span><span class="text-var">$document</span>);     <span class="text-comment">// the compiled byte count</span>
</code></pre>
</div>

